      "text": "It was Iris. Iris won."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3363,
      "text": "I wish Iris would finish Elden Ring."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3365,
      "text": "I would've won. Iris versus Elden Ring stream."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3368,
      "text": "Yeah, you would've won."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3370,
      "text": "100%. If only."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3468,
      "text": "driving games. But I know that, like,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3470,
      "text": "there's Mario Kart tournaments"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3472,
      "text": "and stuff, and I want to get better"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3476,
      "text": "I can join those and not"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3478,
      "text": "be a drag,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3480,
      "text": "you know, drag"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3486,
      "text": "got that feeling, especially after the"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3488,
      "text": "Pokemon Unite tournament, where, like,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3490,
      "text": "I practiced, and it paid off, and it felt"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3496,
      "text": "maybe I should practice for tournaments regularly"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3498,
      "text": "from now on, so."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3500,
      "text": "Yeah, I hope I can"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3502,
      "text": "join some."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3504,
      "text": "I've been like, oh, they're playing"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3506,
      "text": "Pokemon Unite, oh, they're playing Minecraft,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3510,
      "text": "too, so hopefully I'll be able to join"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3512,
      "text": "one day as well."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3514,
      "text": "I'm trying, that's why I'm"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3516,
      "text": "trying to prove myself as a gamer, so that"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3518,
      "text": "people will want me. Please want me."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3520,
      "text": "Please want me, Senpai."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3522,
      "text": "I'm good at games,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3524,
      "text": "and if not, I will keep going."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3526,
      "text": "You don't even need to ask."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3622,
      "text": "because she has to prepare"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3624,
      "text": "for a very, very important"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3626,
      "text": "thing. It's also a good thing that"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3628,
      "text": "I beat"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3630,
      "text": "that first try, because"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3632,
      "text": "I would've tried again, and again, and again,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3636,
      "text": "beat it. So it's a good thing that I"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3638,
      "text": "won!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3640,
      "text": "You did great!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3642,
      "text": "Callie Senpai, would you like"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3644,
      "text": "to...anything you got going on?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3646,
      "text": "You'd like to shout out before we go?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3648,
      "text": "I would! My"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3650,
      "text": "brand new EP called"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3652,
      "text": "Jigok 6 is coming out. It's a rock rap"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3656,
      "text": "yeah, I'm really proud of it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3658,
      "text": "I like rock!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3660,
      "text": "Yeah, it's..."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3662,
      "text": "I'm really excited. I think it's the best music"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3664,
      "text": "I've made. I feel like it's leagues above"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3666,
      "text": "other stuff that I've put out, and I'm really, really"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3668,
      "text": "proud of it, so. I hope that"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3670,
      "text": "you guys'll like it, and it's pretty much the"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3672,
      "text": "direction that I'm going from here, is"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3772,
      "text": "You can pinch my skin, but there is always a"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3774,
      "text": "skeleton inside of you. That is very true."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3776,
      "text": "Just so you know."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3778,
      "text": "But yeah, go cheer"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3780,
      "text": "Kali-senpai"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3782,
      "text": "on"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3784,
      "text": "during ID Cup."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3786,
      "text": "And thank you for making the time"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3788,
      "text": "for me today."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3790,
      "text": "Even though you're super busy."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3792,
      "text": "Nah, I wanted to."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3794,
      "text": "I wanted to collab. So don't worry."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3796,
      "text": "I hope you enjoyed."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3798,
      "text": "Were you surprised?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3800,
      "text": "Were you surprised? Yeah."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3816,
      "text": "You have bones."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3818,
      "text": "I do. Like I said."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3820,
      "text": "Skeleton inside of everyone."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3938,
      "text": "Yeah. Okay, everybody."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3940,
      "text": "Please say bye-bye"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3942,
      "text": "to me and the voice inside"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3944,
      "text": "my head of dead Kali-senpai."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3946,
      "text": "Goodbye"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3948,
      "text": "humans, rocks, tombstones alike."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3950,
      "text": "Bye. Peace. Oh, yeah."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3952,
      "text": "What is it? We're"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3954,
      "text": "tombstone out."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 3956,
      "text": "Tombstone out. Yeah."
    }
